      "summary": "Renders image files (PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, SVG, ICO, BMP, AVIF) read via the Tauri fs plugin, with VS Code-style smart zoom/fit behavior, checkerboard transparency background, and metadata display.",
      "tags": ["component", "image-preview", "tauri", "file-preview"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Implements VS Code's smart-fit heuristic: images smaller than the container render at 100%, larger ones start in fit mode; zoom stepping walks a fixed ZOOM_LEVELS array."
    },
