      "summary": "Renders video files (mp4, webm, mov, avi, mkv, ogv) using the native <video> element, loading bytes via the Tauri fs plugin into a blob URL and displaying duration/dimensions/size metadata in the shared bottom bar.",
      "tags": ["component", "video-preview", "tauri", "file-preview"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Reads the file into memory and creates a blob: URL rather than using convertFileSrc/asset protocol, avoiding tauri.conf.json asset-scope and CSP restrictions."
